  "conceptual": "\n<h2 id=\"section-21\" sourcefile=\"pdf-headings/chapter-2.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"3\">Section 2.1</h2>\n<p sourcefile=\"pdf-headings/chapter-2.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"5\">This section is on the first page of the chapter.</p>\n<div style=\"break-before: page\"></div>\n<h2 id=\"section-22\" sourcefile=\"pdf-headings/chapter-2.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"9\">Section 2.2</h2>\n<p sourcefile=\"pdf-headings/chapter-2.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"11\">This section starts on a new page.</p>\n<h2 id=\"café\" sourcefile=\"pdf-headings/chapter-2.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"13\">Café</h2>\n<p sourcefile=\"pdf-headings/chapter-2.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"15\">This heading has a non-ASCII id.</p>\n<div style=\"break-before: page\"></div>\n<h2 id=\"中文\" sourcefile=\"pdf-headings/chapter-2.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"19\">中文</h2>\n<p sourcefile=\"pdf-headings/chapter-2.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"21\">This heading has a non-ASCII id.</p>\n<h2 id=\"rd-t\" sourcefile=\"pdf-headings/chapter-2.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"23\">R&amp;D &lt;T&gt;</h2>\n<p sourcefile=\"pdf-headings/chapter-2.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"25\">This heading has characters that must be HTML-escaped.</p>\n<h2 id=\"first-linesecond-line\" sourcefile=\"pdf-headings/chapter-2.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"27\">First line<br>Second line</h2>\n<p sourcefile=\"pdf-headings/chapter-2.md\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"29\">This heading contains a line break.</p>\n",
